                "description": "ID of the managed server."
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "The HTTP POST request to the `/api/v1/backupInfrastructure/managedServers/{id}/updateSingleUseCredentials` path allows you to change from persistent to single-use credentials used to access a Linux server that has the specified `id`. Single-use type of credentials is required if you want to use the Linux server as a hardened repository."
